[2.0, "o", "\u001b[2m00:21\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m\u270e note\u001b[0m \u001b[32mTaking the Jet2.com (LS) seat at 06:52 sim time. 394 departures today out of MAN, 13 flown so far, all on time, load factor 85%. Every department is now manual so the day asks me before it acts. Plan: answer every decision before its deadline, favour keeping flights flying over cancelling, and watch weather at the hub.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
