[0.658, "o", "\u001b[2m00:23\u001b[0m    \u001b[36m\u21b3 weather\u001b[0m \u001b[2m3 weather cells \u00b7 8 regulations: LPA (WA 84), TFS (WA 84), FNC (WA 84), ALC (WA 84), IBZ (WA 84), MJV (WA 84)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.0, "o", "\u001b[2m00:30\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m\u270e note\u001b[0m \u001b[32mWeather check: three cells today, all on our leisure routes. Canaries regulation at LPA and TFS from 09:29 to 15:07 (rate halved, 500+ min of slot delay queued at LPA, 750 at TFS), FNC from 09:56, and the Valencia cell over ALC, IBZ, VLC, REU, MJV from 11:28 to 15:58. Expect a wave of slot decisions on the Canaries and Alicante flights through the middle of the day.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
