[2.0, "o", "\u001b[2m00:35\u001b[0m  \u001b[97mTwo slot decisions are open with 45-second deadlines. LS124 at +16 is minor, so I'll take it. LS125\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m00:35\u001b[0m  \u001b[97mat +43 is worth asking for an improvement.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
