[2.0, "o", "\u001b[2m00:40\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m\u270e note\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFirst slots of the day, both EMA-FNC under the Madeira regulation. LS124 got CTOT 0940, only 16 minutes late, so I took it: a REA there risks little gain and costs attention. LS125 got +43, which is enough to hurt the tail's later rotation, so I sent REA and asked the Network Manager for an improvement; roughly a coin flip, and the downside is just keeping the slot we already have.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
