[1.292, "o", "\u001b[2m00:46\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m\u270e note\u001b[0m \u001b[32mLS281 MAN-FNC has a 61-minute slot under the same Madeira regulation. I announced the delay so passengers hear it before they reach MAN, and sent REA to ask for a better slot: an hour on the outbound rolls into the FNC return and the evening wave, so it is worth the ask.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
