[2.0, "o", "\u001b[2m00:54\u001b[0m  \u001b[97mBoth REAs paid off: LS125 improved to CTOT 1000 and LS281 to 1029. I'll note that and keep polling.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.65, "o", "\u001b[2m00:55\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m\u270e note\u001b[0m \u001b[32mBoth REAs came back with improvements: LS125 moved from CTOT 1010 to 1000 and LS281 from 1039 to 1029. Ten minutes each, small but free. Rule for the rest of the day: take slots under about 20 minutes, ask for better on anything longer.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
