[1.384, "o", "\u001b[2m03:32\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m\u270e note\u001b[0m \u001b[32mBurst of four. LS286 MAN-IBZ 97 minutes late, announced, and its +9 Ibiza slot taken since the aircraft is the constraint. LS346 NCL-REU +16, taken. FR cut LPA-MAN by 11%: this one I matched. Unlike Menorca and Palma, our Gran Canaria returns (LS250, LS249) are only 63 to 69% booked, so there are real seats to fill and an 11% cut is a modest price to keep the price-shoppers from walking to FR.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
